[I] Extensible framework for robust spatial indexing methods

[T] libspatialindex is an extensible C++ framework for robust spatial
[T] indexing methods, providing R*-tree, MVR-tree and TPR-tree indexes with
[T] a C API. It is used by Rtree and other GIS software.

[U] https://libspatialindex.org/

[A] Libspatialindex Authors
